'''Endless Forms Most Beautiful''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Eden of Evolution]]. [[Sage of Selection Darvin]] is introduced here and can be unlocked as a [[Master of Selection Darvin (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] at a 30% chance when beating the stage (guaranteed if a Treasure Radar is used). This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

