==Trivia==
*Endless Forms Most Beautiful's name is a reference to the last paragraph of ''[[wikipedia:On the Origin of Species|On the Origin of Species]]'': "There is grandeur in this view of life, with its several powers, having been originally breathed into a few forms or into one; and that, whilst this planet has gone cycling on according to the fixed law of gravity, from so simple a beginning <u>endless forms most beautiful</u> and most wonderful have been, and are being, evolved."
*The [[Commander Ostromeda]] in Endless Forms Most Beautiful may represent [[wikipedia:Darwin's rhea|Darwin's rhea]], as [[wikipedia:Rhea (bird)|rheas]] are distantly related to ostriches and are also known as "South American ostriches".
*Endless Forms Most Beautiful can be seen as an "evolved" form of [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]], having a stage width of 6,000, a long-reaching boss that spawns after 10 seconds, and unlimited, alternating variants of [[Bore]] ([[Boraphim]]) and [[R.Ost]] (Commander Ostromeda) as constant threats.
*[[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]]'s [[Ultra Form]] was added after Endless Forms Most Beautiful, but appears to have been designed specifically for it. Catman Forever deals massive damage to [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]], is immune to [[Sage of Selection Darvin]]'s Curse and Drain, and has [[Talents]] that also prevent him from being Warped by Commander Ostromeda or Frozen by [[Dogenstein]].

